  "url": "https://www.sofo.org.uk/visit-us/",
  "title": "Visit Us – Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum",
  "metaDescription": "",
  "canonical": "https://www.sofo.org.uk/visit-us/",
  "headings": [
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "Visit Us"
    },
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "VISIT SOFO MUSEUM"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "Everything you need to plan your day out"
    },
    {
      "level": "h4",
      "text": "SOFO Museum first opened during the summer of 2014, tucked away in the beautiful gardens in the grounds of The Oxfordshire Museum and Woodstock Library, and just on the doorstep of Blenheim Palace."
    },
    {
      "level": "h4",
      "text": "More than a local military museum, SOFO is a museum that everyone can enjoy, from kids to parents, and to grandparents. We tell stories of how conflict has affected the county and its people, from soldiers serving on the front lines to ordinary people living on the Home Front."
    },
    {
      "level": "h4",
      "text": "On top of a range of ever-changing displays and events, our permanent exhibits explore topics that you’ll find surprising and moving in equal measure, such as raw accounts of the liberation of Bergen-Belsen from both camp survivors and Oxfordshire soldiers. Battles of the Oxfordshire and Buckinghamshire Light Infantry puts you on-board a Horsa Glider as it prepares to land in Normandy in the early hours of D-Day 1944, while Secret Agents, Secret Armies explores the real world of spies and espionage through the lens of Ian Fleming and James Bond"
    },
    {
      "level": "h4",
      "text": "SOFO holds a collection of over 3,500 objects and 7,500 archive items from two county regiments, the Queens Own Oxfordshire Hussars (QOOH) and the Oxfordshire and Buckinghamshire Light Infantry. These are our starting point for reflecting on the county’s rich and diverse military heritage."
    },
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "What people say about us"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "SOFO Museum is great day out, but don't just take our word for it..."
    },
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "What's the best time to drop in?"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "Autism Friendly Visits"
    },
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "Buying a ticket"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "Just drop in, or book tickets in advance - it's up to you!"
    },
    {
      "level": "h4",
      "text": "Family Tickets"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "Blenheim Annual Pass Offer"
    },
    {
      "level": "h4",
      "text": "Free admission to the Main Gallery for visitors with a current and valid Blenheim Annual Pass."
    },
    {
      "level": "h4",
      "text": "Please bring your Annual and/or Privilege Passes with you to take advantage of the free admission offer."
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "GoodJourney"
    },
    {
      "level": "h4",
      "text": "Travel a greener way for discounts! Enjoy 2for1 standard entry when you show a train or bus ticket from the day of your visit. Find out more about getting here car-free at GoodJourney."
    },
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "Getting Here"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "We're tucked away in Woodstock at the bottom of The Oxfordshire Museum's beautiful gardens, on the doorstep of Blenheim Palace's Woodstock Gate."
    },
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "More Useful Info"
    },
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "Need to get in touch?"
    },
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "Welcome Guides"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "Translated Guides to SOFO Museum (PDF)"
    },
    {
      "level": "h1",
      "text": "Useful Links"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "More great stuff to see do in Woodstock and the surrounding area!"
    }
  ],
